# Connive (CR 701.50a, 608.2h): the life is paid as a cost, so it is gone for good. Bot2 answers the activation with a Lightning Bolt that kills
# M.O.D.O.K. (a 2/2; Bot1's creatures are not shrunk by it). The ability still resolves: Bot1 draws a card and discards the Lightning Bolt, but
# there is no creature on the battlefield to put a +1/+1 counter on, so the discard of a nonland card changes nothing.

